OL,3,GNEWSABurst water main hits homes and
OL,4,Acloses schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of properties are without
OL,7,Fwater or have low pressure in parts of
OL,8,FSurrey and London after a "large burst
OL,9,Fwater main" disrupted supply.
OL,11,FThames Water said it was making
OL,12,Fprogress on repairing the burst in
OL,13,FMolesey, which affected up to 15,000
OL,14,Fproperties in Thames Ditton, Esher, and
OL,15,FSunbury, plus other parts of Surrey and
OL,16,Fsouth London.
OL,18,FLong Ditton Infant and Nursery School
OL,19,Fand Thames Ditton Infant School, in
OL,20,FSurrey, said they had closed for the
OL,21,Fday due to the issue, which was first
OL,22,Freported at about 05:15 BST.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
