OL,3,GNEWSABurst water main hits homes and
OL,4,Acloses schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Thames Water spokesperson apologised
OL,7,Fto customers, adding it would "likely
OL,8,Ftake some time to fix", but said the
OL,9,Fnumber of customers affected had
OL,10,Freduced to 6,000.
